  <description>
    <p>
      A turn based strategy game with a pixel art style! Over 30 levels and 30 unit types!
    </p> 
    <p>
      The game is based on the Omicron java game engine. Runs on Android, Linux, Windows and on the Browser.
    </p>     
    <p>
      Most graphics by: Stavros - Sound and music by: Fubuki
    </p>
  </description>
  
